<title>UK: Fedex starts round-the-world flight in Sept.</title>
<headline>Fedex starts round-the-world flight in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Express is launching a scheduled round-the-world flight in September said Theodore.L. Weise, executive vice president, worldwide operations in a statement.</p>
<p>The daily flight will originate in Indianapolis and connect Europe to the Middle East and Asia via Paris, Dubai, Bombay, Bangkok and Fedex's Asia Pacific Hub at Subic Bay in the Philippines.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
